# ===========================================================================
#  µnleashed BBS directory
#  Line endings. The server runs on Linux; a CRLF in a shell script gives
#  "bad interpreter" and a CRLF in a systemd unit is quietly ignored.
# ===========================================================================
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
